From: GIMP Modernization Team <team@gimp.org>
Subject: [PATCH 0002/0004] UI/UX Modernization: Dark Pro / OLED Design System & Ergonomic Controls

Implements the Dark Pro & OLED high-contrast design system in gimp.css,
integrates custom pill sliders (GimpSpinScale), minimalist tabs with focus indicators,
single-column tool palette layout, and discrete scrollbars.
---
